---
permalink: /ui_kits/website/annual-reports.html
headline: Annual Reports & Accounts
deck: As a registered charity, we publish our annual report and financial statements each year. You are warmly welcome to read them.
lead: Each year our Annual Report and Financial Statements are presented at the Annual Parochial Church Meeting (APCM) and made available to the whole congregation.
documents:
  - title: Annual Report 2026
    description: PDF · Presented at the 2026 APCM
    href: https://emmanuelchurchnw6.sharepoint.com/:b:/g/IQDgF3ZE7OOQS7zxVUhrKhw5ARaeBa64qaFlJhcFBm57QtQ?e=2xWAci
    icon: document
  - title: Financial Statements
    description: Folder · Annual accounts & financial statements
    href: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14A74nipr9J063KBBS8ChooKW--FkoCOt
    icon: folder
archive_note: Earlier years' reports will be linked here as they are added to the archive.
callout_heading: Questions about our governance?
callout_body: Members of the congregation are always welcome to ask about the PCC, our finances, or how decisions are made at Emmanuel.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>{{ headline }} — Emmanuel Church, West Hampstead</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png" />
</head>
<body>

{% include "header.njk" %}

  <section class="em-pagehead em-pagehead--band em-pagehead--plain">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><a href="our-team.html">About Us</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Annual Reports</span></div>
      <h1 data-editable="text" data-prop="headline" data-type="span">{{ headline }}</h1>
      <p class="deck" data-editable="text" data-prop="deck" data-type="text">{{ deck }}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="em-intro em-intro--solo">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-body">
        <p class="em-lead" data-editable="text" data-prop="lead" data-type="text">{{ lead }}</p>
        {# Array Editable Region: add / remove / reorder document rows in Visual or Data #}
        <div style="margin-top:40px" data-editable="array" data-prop="documents">
          {% for doc in documents %}
          <a href="{{ doc.href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="em-doc" data-editable="array-item">
            <div class="ic">
              {% if doc.icon == "folder" %}
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 9h18M9 3v18"/><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/></svg>
              {% else %}
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 3v5h5"/><path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M8 13h8M8 17h6"/></svg>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="doc-main">
              <div class="t" data-editable="text" data-prop="title" data-type="span">{{ doc.title }}</div>
              <div class="d" data-editable="text" data-prop="description" data-type="span">{{ doc.description }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="arr">Open ↗</div>
          </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="em-placeholder" style="margin-top:40px">
          <p data-editable="text" data-prop="archive_note" data-type="text">{{ archive_note }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="em-callout">
    <div class="inner">
      <div>
        <h3 data-editable="text" data-prop="callout_heading" data-type="span">{{ callout_heading }}</h3>
        <p data-editable="text" data-prop="callout_body" data-type="text">{{ callout_body }}</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a href="electoral-roll.html" class="em-btn em-btn--tan">Join the electoral roll</a><a href="contact.html" class="em-btn em-btn--ghost-light">Contact the parish office</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
